### 1. Register John Student User (Auth Service)
POST {{authUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "alex Student",
  "email": "alex.student1@school.edu",
  "admissionNumber": "ADM/2026/0011",
  "role": "student",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 2. Register Parent Guardian User (Auth Service)
POST {{authUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Parent Guardian",
  "email": "parent1@gmail1.com",
  "phone": "+254798765432",
  "role": "parent",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 3. Register Student Profile linked to Class & Parent (Students Service)
POST {{studentUrl}}
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "admissionNumber": "ADM/2026/0011",
  "upiNumber": "UPI9876543210",
  "parentId": "{{parentId}}",
  "classId": "{{classId}}",
  "dateOfBirth": "2015-06-12",
  "gender": "Male",
  "enrollmentDate": "2026-01-05",
  "isEnrolled": true
}

### 4. Link Parent to Student (Auth Service)
POST {{authUrl}}/link-parent
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "parentId": "{{parentId}}"
}

### 5. Get All Students by School (Students Service)
GET {{studentUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 6. Get Student by ID with Full Relations (Students Service)
GET {{studentUrl}}/{{registeredStudentId}}
Cookie: token={{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 7. Update Student Details (Students Service)
PUT {{studentUrl}}/{{registeredStudentId}}
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender": "Male",
  "isEnrolled": true
}

### 8. Create Student Enrollment History Record (Students Service)
POST {{studentUrl}}/enrollment-history
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{registeredStudentId}}",
  "termId": "{{termId}}",
  "gradeLevel": "Grade 5",
  "stream": "East",
  "status": "Active"
}

### 9. Get Student Enrollment History (Students Service)
GET {{studentUrl}}/{{registeredStudentId}}/enrollment-history
Cookie: token={{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 10. Delete Student Record (Students Service)
DELETE {{studentUrl}}/{{studentId}}
Cookie: token={{schoolAdminToken}}